itle":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>archderd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455144#post1455144\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">this might just be me but &quot;i don't know&quot; isn't much of an explanation</div> </div> </div> </div>True, bit t is better to just say you don't know than to equivocate about how much you don't know. Though he probably could have trimmed it down a little.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-18T18:58:44-07:00","id":1455154,"title":"","content":"Holy hell. I haven't kept up with the development of that game since May 2020, I think, and had no idea what a cluster it had turned into. <br /> <br /> I'm glad I got a refund for my preorder when I did.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-18T20:45:50-07:00","id":1455163,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>archderd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455144#post1455144\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">this might just be me but &quot;i don't know&quot; isn't much of an explanation</div> </div> </div> </div>It's weird he says that since he explains AT GREAT LENGTH what went wrong. I can only assume that he threw that in the end to avoid libel because it's very clearly, &quot;I do know and here is how&quot; for 99% of the article.<br /> <br /> Either that or he just had a very poor choice of how to end his article.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-18-2021, 11:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T06:35:11-07:00","id":1455190,"title":"","content":"Luckily, I ordered this through Evil Amazon. They don't charge you until it ships, so nothing lost here. But it's a deep shame.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T07:00:39-07:00","id":1455192,"title":"","content":"Someone explain their interpretation. From my perspective, it seemed like someone with power wanted all the writing done a certain way and other writers were only hired to add legimacy to an exec's pet story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T08:48:02-07:00","id":1455198,"title":"","content":"While I lived and worked in Samoa, I had the opportunity to explain the American idiom &quot;boondoggle&quot; to Samoans, Australians, and people from New Zealand.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>noun</i><br /> noun: <b>boondoggle</b>; plural noun: <b>boondoggles</b><br /> <br /> <br /> work or activity that is wasteful or pointless but gives the appearance of having value. </div> </div> </div>I doubt anyone thought Bloodlines2 was going to turn into a boondoggle, but it did so steadily and apparently irreversibly. I wonder how often that happens in the corporate world. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T14:14:01-07:00","id":1455213,"title":"","content":"Wow. They had Mitsoda and Avellone working on the game?<br /> <br /> Holy shit. Bloodlines 2 could have been great. Huge fan of both of their past work. <br /> <br /> Damn shame. Glad I never pre-ordered this. Or spent much time following the game beyond &quot;I'll get it once it's out.&quot; <br /> <br /> Guess that's never.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T18:08:46-07:00","id":1455222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455192#post1455192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone explain their interpretation. From my perspective, it seemed like someone with power wanted all the writing done a certain way and other writers were only hired to add legimacy to an exec's pet story.</div> </div> </div> </div>As near as I can tell, the ANSWER is that they were well on their way to making their deadline when both Brian Mitsoda and Avellone were abruptly fired and their stuff was removed. This was before Avellone's controversy by the way (and he has an article on that). Furthermore, they removed ALL of the side content and started from scratch while leaving the main quest untouched. This, of course, meant the game was suddenly like halfway as done as it was before.<br /> <br /> After Avellone left, it apparently got worse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T18:27:05-07:00","id":1455225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455222#post1455222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After Avellone left, it apparently got worse.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am curious, though not overly so, about what happened in terms of office politics that made management think it was a good idea to pull these tricks. I mean, what did they think they were accomplishing by firing Mitsoda and Avellone and ripping out most of the work the men had added? What answers did the Hardsuit give to the IP holders when the &quot;what the hell&quot; calls from the IP and investors started?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T18:41:25-07:00","id":1455226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455225#post1455225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am curious, though not overly so, about what happened in terms of office politics that made management think it was a good idea to pull these tricks. I mean, what did they think they were accomplishing by firing Mitsoda and Avellone and ripping out most of the work the men had added? What answers did the Hardsuit give to the IP holders when the &quot;what the hell&quot; calls from the IP and investors started?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I'm wondering about that as well. I mean, even the 30 minute demo obviously took a lot of work and money. All of this office drama resulted in someone losing a massive investment. Speaking as someone who plays the stock market, feeling like you might as well have set your money on fire on a failed investment is very painful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T20:01:51-07:00","id":1455231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455225#post1455225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am curious, though not overly so, about what happened in terms of office politics that made management think it was a good idea to pull these tricks. I mean, what did they think they were accomplishing by firing Mitsoda and Avellone and ripping out most of the work the men had added? What answers did the Hardsuit give to the IP holders when the &quot;what the hell&quot; calls from the IP and investors started?</div> </div> </div> </div>Notably, Brian Mitsoda said in his response he had NO IDEA why he was fired and why they removed his stuff. So this seems to have been a decision made unilaterally.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-20T00:21:10-07:00","id":1455241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455222#post1455222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As near as I can tell, the ANSWER is that they were well on their way to making their deadline when both Brian Mitsoda and Avellone were abruptly fired and their stuff was removed. This was before Avellone's controversy by the way (and he has an article on that). Furthermore, they removed ALL of the side content and started from scratch while leaving the main quest untouched. This, of course, meant the game was suddenly like halfway as done as it was before.<br /> <br /> After Avellone left, it apparently got worse.</div> </div> </div> </div>What's Avellone's controversy?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-20T01:07:47-07:00","id":1455243,"title":"","content":"You hear about Kevin Smith and his attempts to write superman lives? A producer demanded that superman never wears his suit, never flies, and there has to be a giant mechanical spider in the third act. That's half what I imagine why bloodlines is so fucked. Perhaps you've got someone wanting the vampires to be just like Underworld, or perhaps you've got some genuine disagreements about the nature of the setting/how much V5 there will be in the new game. There's also the part where A: Vampire is an extremely political game and some execs are too american to deal with any of that commy propaganda, or B: The Game is too adult and R-Ratings are absolute sale killers. That's all the reasons to throw out writing at least, unless of course the writing's no good, but Bloodlines had pretty good writing aside from all the base sex appeal and how absurdly dumb the Prince/nines comes across. I'll always applaud Jeanette for her ability to take that amulet from players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-20T05:22:25-07:00","id":1455247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455241#post1455241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What's Avellone's controversy?</div> </div> </div> </div>He had several women come forward claiming that he sexually assaulted them (groping them, kissing them, etc), propositioned them for sex, etc. He claims those incidents were consensual or that there was implied consent and he stopped immediately and apologized when he was told to stop. But the women said he never apologized at the time, and notably in his official comments on the incidents he hasn't offered too many apologies for what he did, mostly just self-righteous defenses and indignation and he's filed a lawsuit against them for libel. He would hardly be the first scummy guy to get caught doing stuff like this, and I can easily believe things happened the way the women said.<br /> <br /> As far as Bloodlines 2 is concerned, note that his contributions to the game were removed before any of these accusations came out. So they had already removed his stuff from the game for some reason entirely unrelated to all of this.<br /> <br /> Here's the first article discussing what the women said -<br /> <a href=\"https://kotaku.com/multiple-women-accuse-games-writer-chris-avellone-of-se-1844135498\" target=\"_blank\">https://kotaku.com/multiple-women-ac...-se-1844135498</a><br /> <br /> Here's a more recent article on the ongoing case<br /> <a href=\"https://www.pcgamer.com/chris-avellone-files-libel-suit-over-last-years-sexual-misconduct-allegations/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.pcgamer.com/chris-avello...t-allegations/</a><br /> <br /> I like Avellone's writing, and I think his work in Knights of the Old Republic 2 is some of the best writing in any video game ever, but it seems likely he's a somewhat scummy human being.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 07-20-2021, 08:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-20T10:47:06-07:00","id":1455266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455247#post1455247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He had several women come forward claiming that he sexually assaulted them (groping them, kissing them, etc), propositioned them for sex, etc. He claims those incidents were consensual or that there was implied consent and he stopped immediately and apologized when he was told to stop. But the women said he never apologized at the time, and notably in his official comments on the incidents he hasn't offered too many apologies for what he did, mostly just self-righteous defenses and indignation and he's filed a lawsuit against them for libel. He would hardly be the first scummy guy to get caught doing stuff like this, and I can easily believe things happened the way the women said.<br /> <br /> As far as Bloodlines 2 is concerned, note that his contributions to the game were removed before any of these accusations came out. So they had already removed his stuff from the game for some reason entirely unrelated to all of this.<br /> <br /> Here's the first article discussing what the women said -<br /> <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;https://kotaku.com/multiple-women-accuse-games-writer-chris-avellone-of-se-1844135498&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">https://kotaku.com/multiple-women-ac...-se-1844135498</a><br /> <br /> Here's a more recent article on the ongoing case<br /> <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;https://www.pcgamer.com/chris-avellone-files-libel-suit-over-last-years-sexual-misconduct-allegations/&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.pcgamer.com/chris-avello...t-allegations/</a><br /> <br /> I like Avellone's writing, and I think his work in Knights of the Old Republic 2 is some of the best writing in any video game ever, but it seems likely he's a somewhat scummy human being.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh shit. Sorry for bringing it up. I, naively, assumed it was to do with him writing a game, but should've guessed it was this sort of shit. Isn't it always?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-20T23:24:40-07:00","id":1455293,"title":"","content":"Ignore this. I didn't read the previous post from AnubisXy fully.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 07-21-2021, 03:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-20T23:43:09-07:00","id":1455295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455163#post1455163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's weird he says that since he explains AT GREAT LENGTH what went wrong. I can only assume that he threw that in the end to avoid libel because it's very clearly, &quot;I do know and here is how&quot; for 99% of the article.<br /> <br /> Either that or he just had a very poor choice of how to end his article.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, he explains a lot of problems that plagued the game's development, but he doesn't have an ultimate answer. He was off the project long before it got shelved and he has no final statement to make. &quot;I don't know&quot; is accurate here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-20T23:46:35-07:00","id":1455296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455266#post1455266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh shit. Sorry for bringing it up. I, naively, assumed it was to do with him writing a game, but should've guessed it was this sort of shit. Isn't it always?</div> </div> </div> </div>To expand, this year Avellone came back with a statement in his defense: <a href=\"https://chrisavellone.medium.com/its-come-to-this-chris-avellone-2fe5db836746\" target=\"_blank\">https://chrisavellone.medium.com/its...e-2fe5db836746</a><br /> And was backed by Karissa's coworker showing chat logs that paint Karissa in a rather different light: <a href=\"https://jeffdjohnson.medium.com/beyond-politics-beliefs-or-life-choices-this-is-about-right-and-wrong-39d05699f2f4\" target=\"_blank\">https://jeffdjohnson.medium.com/beyo...g-39d05699f2f4</a><br /> <br /> In the absence of any legal pursuit from Karissa or Avellone, the situation currently is murky at best.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-21T00:14:04-07:00","id":1455297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kammerer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455296#post1455296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To expand, this year Avellone came back with a statement in his defense: <a href=\"https://chrisavellone.medium.com/its-come-to-this-chris-avellone-2fe5db836746\" target=\"_blank\">https://chrisavellone.medium.com/its...e-2fe5db836746</a><br /> And was backed by Karissa's coworker showing chat logs that paint Karissa in a rather different light: <a href=\"https://jeffdjohnson.medium.com/beyond-politics-beliefs-or-life-choices-this-is-about-right-and-wrong-39d05699f2f4\" target=\"_blank\">https://jeffdjohnson.medium.com/beyo...g-39d05699f2f4</a><br /> <br /> In the absence of any legal pursuit from Karissa or Avellone, the situation currently is murky at best.</div> </div> </div> </div>I read this just now and... I don't think this disproves anything. Grooming makes you think you *want* to be abused. That's how abusers get away with stuff for years. These texts don't prove anything about what happened behind closed doors; they only reveal how someone rationalised what happened at the time. <br /> <br /> But anyway, I think it's best if we leave this well enough alone and not derail the thread any more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-21T13:56:24-07:00","id":1455325,"title":"","content":"My inclination is that I treat the subject seriously enough that I don't think of the man the same way and will avoid his projects in the future. Chris Avellone's behavior sounds very much like the kind of sexual harassment that went on in a lot of the cons I used to attend with nerd celebrities in gaming or comics and a large part of why I stopped attending them. They think they're rock stars and behave like it, leaving lots of people deeply disillusioned. A similar controversy happened with Scott Lynch (Gentleman Bastards) that tore through the fantasy community I belong to.<br /> <br /> It doesn't mean Avellone's not a source of information on what happened to Bloodlines 2, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-21-2021, 05:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-22T00:16:49-07:00","id":1455347,"title":"","content":"Yup. I trust him for Bloodlines updates. He was there, after all, and we weren't. It's just such a pity we got so close and yet remain so far...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-22T18:09:46-07:00","id":1455403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455243#post1455243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Game is too adult and R-Ratings are absolute sale killers.</div> </div> </div> </div>R-Raitings are sale killers, what? Doom, TLOU games, GTA games, Mortal Kombat games, Witcher 3, Gears of War series and many more had excellent sales and they were R-Rating.<br /> <br /> Good game will always sale. Rating is not important.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24341-viben","name":"Viben","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-22T20:21:20-07:00","id":1455409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Viben</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455403#post1455403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> R-Raitings are sale killers, what? Doom, TLOU games, GTA games, Mortal Kombat games, Witcher 3, Gears of War series and many more had excellent sales and they were R-Rating.<br /> <br /> Good game will always sale. Rating is not important.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Mature rating&quot; games always sell unlike movies where it's considered better to do PG-13.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-23T04:02:01-07:00","id":1455430,"title":"","content":"Well, it is a thread about a video game...<br /> <br /> But even then, the idea that R-rated movies don't sell isn't accurate either. PG-13 is the prefer rating for big budget blockbusters; movies that need to do huge numbers because they cost a ton to make. G and PG turn off older audiences, and R (or higher) cut out the younger ones. R-ratings do just fine in the right hands; there's no genre thing here. The Joker broke $1 billion at the box office with an R, but the top grossing R movies span horror, action, comedy, period drama, and even one shonen anime. There's also the hugely successful returns (even if not posting those sorts of big numbers) on low budget genre flicks. Horror tends to dominate here (at least in the US), as the R-rating turns into sales just like M for video games or the Parental Advisory sticker back when music was bought on physical media. When a studio makes a horror movie for $5 to $10 million, they'll usually amp up the material to get an R, because they know horror fans tend to think PG-13 means it's going to be too tame to be scary.<br /> <br /> Of course exceptions abound.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-23T08:27:03-07:00","id":1455440,"title":"","content":"R-Rating does not even stop kids with parental allowance to not watch those movies. I watched tons of R-Rated movies with my parents before at the movie theaters when I was young. At best it puts a tighter low-hanging threshold on how many kids watch the R-Rated film in the theaters when it debuts. Later on as the said movie gets on in ages and starts going to DVD or on stuff like Netflix, anyone at the point can watch it anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-23T08:29:23-07:00","id":1455441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455247#post1455247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He had several women come forward claiming that he sexually assaulted them (groping them, kissing them, etc), propositioned them for sex, etc. [...]</div> </div> </div> </div>Goddamn, really? I had no idea. <br /> <br /> I loved Avellone's work on KotOR 2, Mask of the Betrayer, and Planescape: Torment. I interviewed him once for a Star Wars gaming site and he seemed nice. <br /> <br /> I'm not going to condemn the dude before taking time to read up on the controversy. Some accusations have merit, some don't, and those of us who weren't there have to evaluate the evidence and decide for ourselves. But goddamn. <br /> <br /> Why does everything have to be horrible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-23T10:36:29-07:00","id":1455446,"title":"","content":"I remember walking into an 18-rated movie (Blade 2) here in the UK when I was only 13 and my sister was 11, because we were with our aunt. Cinemas seem to be pretty lax on checking ID.<br /> <br /> Loads of things rated R in America were rated 18 here, and kids still watched them! (Though, interestingly, a lot have been re-rated as 15 now. The Alien films are the most obvious. They originally had an 18 rating because of the sexual undertones of the xenomorph and its life cycle.)<br /> <br /> I remember being in primary school, from ages 9-11, and borrowing all manner of 18 certificate films from my friends. Kids like being scared and they like doing things they're not supposed to even more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T07:25:14-07:00","id":1455509,"title":"","content":"You all seem to be under the belief that studio executives are rational actors that have achieved their positions through merit. Some of you have also insinuated that your cool, liberal minded parents are the standard for all parents. I think you're all a little too overeager to refute me here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T10:21:17-07:00","id":1455522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455509#post1455509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You all seem to be under the belief that studio executives are rational actors that have achieved their positions through merit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kind of hate to agree with MyWifeIsScary, but I think he is correct. I suspect whomever killed the game (about vampires) because it could not be made &quot;PG&quot; was working on their own preconceived notions about success. Well, they were working on that and whatever the opposite of the &quot;sunk cost fallacy&quot; might be.<br /> <br /> The entire scenario reminds me of the collapse of the VtM MMORPG a few years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T15:34:28-07:00","id":1455536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455509#post1455509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You all seem to be under the belief that studio executives are rational actors that have achieved their positions through merit.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's still a job, and you still have to perform the job to keep it (or have someone else make smart decisions you can claim as your own anyway).<br /> <br /> And we don't need to assume anything about individual executives, we can look at things like sales data to see that, for the most part, studios have internalized ideas about how to make money off of properties, and those norms do not actually include the idea that either political messages, or an R/M/etc. rating &quot;kills sales.&quot; Executives are, if nothing else, generally good at following trends (the trend setters tend to be the exceptions after all). When they see Blumhouse turning into a juggernaut of a studio on the backs of a bunch of low budget R-rated horror flicks that had huge returns for the investment, they're at least capable of saying, &quot;oh, so that's how you make money off of R-rated stuff, lets do that too.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Some of you have also insinuated that your cool, liberal minded parents are the standard for all parents. </div> </div> </div>What makes you think this is a liberal thing? IME liberal parents are more likely to be the ones that micromanage what their kids watch and be sensitive to maturity ratings (even if not dogmatically abiding of them). Conservative parents are more likely to just drop their kids off at the theater with enough money for tickets and food, because (esp. in the US) they consider helicopter parenting a liberal thing; and their kids know perfectly well to lie if they see something their parents would object to, it's just not about what it was rated.<br /> <br /> Because I'm old, but these things haven't changed that much: I got Mortal Kombat 1 when it first came out. I got my liberal open minded mother to buy it for me, but I had to have a whole conversation with her where I had to show I know the difference between fantasy violence and reality, and so on, before she'd agree to it. One of my friends with a far more conservative father saved up their lawn mowing money, and then had their older brother buy the game for them and never bothered telling their father about it.<br /> <br /> The end result is still that lots of kids watch movies/play games/etc. that the ratings systems say they're too young to handle deciding to see on their own.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I think you're all a little too overeager to refute me here. </div> </div> </div>That tends to happen when you say something that's fairly obviously wrong. The idea that Paradox (you know, the executives in all this) are afraid of political messages or a Mature rating on their Vampire video games is ridiculous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T16:17:20-07:00","id":1455538,"title":"","content":"...anyways.<br /> <br /> Something that struck out to me the most was that, according to Avellone, PDX didn't pitch to anyone to Bloodlines 2 and HSL happened to bite. Rather, that it was HSL that pitched to PDX (with Avellone's help.<br /> <br /> Meaning...PDX never actively sought to get a Bloodlines 2 to get made. They only pushed for it when someone else to come with an idea.<br /> <br /> Which once again...so PDX wants to make a big push to make WoD a multimedia brand...and yet relies on others to do all the work for them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T17:08:03-07:00","id":1455541,"title":"","content":"Mind u, I am one of the people who think Paradox was in the right to take it away from Hardsuit. It seems to have been a good game but it was on the way to being delivered first quarter and went completely off the rails.<br /> <br /> I think of Paradox as the people rescuing the manuscript from the depressed writer's fireplace.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T17:40:14-07:00","id":1455546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455538#post1455538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Meaning...PDX never actively sought to get a Bloodlines 2 to get made. They only pushed for it when someone else to come with an idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even as someone that doesn't like how Paradox is handling things...<br /> <br /> I don't think that's fair. Paradox might have simply been waiting to start the push for Bloodlines 2 at that point, and then the HSL pitch convinced them to change their timetable. Paradox had the license for the WoD for less than a year before Bloodlines 2 was started. I think that the idea that they weren't trying to make Bloodlines 2 that fast internally was actually smart thinking on their part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T20:02:45-07:00","id":1455552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455541#post1455541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think of Paradox as the people rescuing the manuscript from the depressed writer's fireplace.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't know about that, if anything I'm left with the impression it was even more of Paradox's fault over HSL.<br /> <br /> Even now, where we're months later after the initial announcement that they kicked HSL off, and yet we've heard nothing about who the new studio is that's taking over BL2. That PDX claimed that they're not completely throwing out HSL's work, and yet...why the silence?<br /> <br /> (and this is on top of other stuff like still hearing nothing official about W5 since they kicked out HE)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T20:40:23-07:00","id":1455555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455552#post1455552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even now, where we're months later after the initial announcement that they kicked HSL off, and yet we've heard nothing about who the new studio is that's taking over BL2. That PDX claimed that they're not completely throwing out HSL's work, and yet...why the silence</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine because it's a huge fucking mess and it's taking Paradox months to go in an figure out where the problems were. Especially since, according to Avellone, nobody at Paradox who was working with HSL on Bloodlines 2 is still working at Paradox. So they basically have an entirely new team who had nothing to do with the project being done by another company having to go in and look at this project (which my guess is that it's in extremely bad shape) and then finding a third company to try and dump that hot mess onto. It's a clusterfuck by any definition and I'm not surprised Paradox hasn't said anything about it. And honestly speaking, I would not be at all surprised if Bloodlines 2 ended up like Starcraft Ghost and just never ended up being released.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-24T20:50:02-07:00","id":1455556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455555#post1455555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And honestly speaking, I would not be at all surprised if Bloodlines 2 ended up like Starcraft Ghost and just never ended up being released.</div> </div> </div> </div>...which probably make things worse.<br /> <br /> It'd make PDX look even more like incompetent fools since it involves a game that already had an extensive marketing campaign (not just the one teaser trailer released and then nothing else after wards), including taking pre-orders, which included Limited and Collector's Editions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T15:47:51-07:00","id":1455587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455556#post1455556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...which probably make things worse.<br /> <br /> It'd make PDX look even more like incompetent fools since it involves a game that already had an extensive marketing campaign (not just the one teaser trailer released and then nothing else after wards), including taking pre-orders, which included Limited and Collector's Editions.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno, they hired a guy from Ubisoft with a history of getting troubled games to market (and Ubisoft has a history of planned games going completely to shit even without their internal horrors) but apparently he said, &quot;The best bet is to fire these guys. They have utterly boned things.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T16:36:16-07:00","id":1455590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455556#post1455556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...which probably make things worse.<br /> <br /> It'd make PDX look even more like incompetent fools since it involves a game that already had an extensive marketing campaign (not just the one teaser trailer released and then nothing else after wards), including taking pre-orders, which included Limited and Collector's Editions.</div> </div> </div> </div>It would definitely be more in keeping with what I'd expect from a rent-seeking property owner type company to want the content shoveled out the door and onto shelves, regardless of whether it's any good.<br /> <br /> This whole affair's an enigma to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-25T23:20:55-07:00","id":1455596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455587#post1455587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I dunno, they hired a guy from Ubisoft with a history of getting troubled games to market (and Ubisoft has a history of planned games going completely to shit even without their internal horrors) but apparently he said, &amp;quot;The best bet is to fire these guys. They have utterly boned things.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, so is this what has happened? I didn't know that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-26T01:13:34-07:00","id":1455600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455596#post1455596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, so is this what has happened? I didn't know that.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was announced a few months before the cancellation. Effectively, this seems to have been when Paradox was starting to wonder what the fuck was taking so long and how they'd gone from a March 2020 release to, &quot;No chance in Hell.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-26T02:06:51-07:00","id":1455601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455538#post1455538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...anyways.<br /> <br /> Something that struck out to me the most was that, according to Avellone, PDX didn't pitch to anyone to Bloodlines 2 and HSL happened to bite. Rather, that it was HSL that pitched to PDX (with Avellone's help.<br /> <br /> Meaning...PDX never actively sought to get a Bloodlines 2 to get made. They only pushed for it when someone else to come with an idea.<br /> <br /> Which once again...so PDX wants to make a big push to make WoD a multimedia brand...and yet relies on others to do all the work for them?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a good time to remember that the acquisition of White Wolf and reboot of WoD was a vanity project of Fredrik Wester, a personal friend of Martin Ericsson, and then CEO of Paradox Interactive. Wester left the company in August 2018.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-26T04:39:17-07:00","id":1455608,"title":"","content":"Left the company is a bit off. He is the executive chairman of the company, which means he still has some say over daily operations, and he's the largest single shareholder in the company. So he still has a large amount of sway over what happens at Paradox even if most employees of the company don't answer directly to him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-26T17:16:52-07:00","id":1455630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455608#post1455608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Left the company is a bit off. He is the executive chairman of the company, which means he still has some say over daily operations, and he's the largest single shareholder in the company. So he still has a large amount of sway over what happens at Paradox even if most employees of the company don't answer directly to him.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, &quot;Let's do Bloodlines 2&quot; isn't a bad thing for the company.<br /> <br /> And if you can get someone to pay you to license it, so much the better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-26T17:26:01-07:00","id":1455632,"title":"","content":"I don't disagree?<br /> <br /> I think that they rushed into Bloodlines 2 because they got a good pitch from HSL (which Avellone agrees he was part of making so compelling even if potentially to the products behind-the-scenes detriment). Bloodlines 2 should have probably gotten more time for Paradox (and at the time WW-as-subsidiary) to decide exactly how the WoD properties were going to be handled, there probably should have been a more exhaustive pitch process than, &quot;the first folks that pitch us, lets go with them without even looking around,&quot; and so on.<br /> <br /> My point about Wester is that if he was the big push to make the WoD a significant part of Paradox's portfolio, his no longer being CEO doesn't mean he doesn't still have the power to push that particular effort within the company.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-27T05:16:47-07:00","id":1455650,"title":"","content":"The thing is it seems to have been going fine right up until it was utterly trashed by someone who was against Avelone and Mitsoda's contributions.<br /> <br /> At some point they seemed to want to start over and that was just an incredibly bad internal decision, whatever the jankiness of certain controls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-27T08:11:03-07:00","id":1455659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455536#post1455536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">.<br /> <br /> That tends to happen when you say something that's fairly obviously wrong. The idea that Paradox (you know, the executives in all this) are afraid of political messages or a Mature rating on their Vampire video games is ridiculous.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's 'polical messages' and then there's 'political statements'. The WoD is very much extreme and outspoken in a lot of areas, to the point that you can't do it justice without getting on a blacklist. a faithful WoD game should be banned by at least 3 countries. You would also do well to remember that game journalists get terrified by the notion of drinking blood, and are constantly seeking something to take out of context and be outraged about in order to maximise their clicks. Of course execs will get wishy washy with including such things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-27T13:11:06-07:00","id":1455678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455650#post1455650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing is it seems to have been going fine right up until it was utterly trashed by someone who was against Avelone and Mitsoda's contributions.<br /> <br /> At some point they seemed to want to start over and that was just an incredibly bad internal decision, whatever the jankiness of certain controls.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is why Paradox shouldn't have rushed to get stuff out so fast. It's not like there was some deadline where if they didn't get their own WoD material out by such-and-such date the property would be forever dead. Paradox not having an operational vision for what to do with their acquisition until two years after people were working on products for it is exactly how you get into these sorts of messes. If Paradox and nWW had sat down and spent the first year of ownership of these things profiting off of Onyx Path and BNS (and whoever else they could have tossed a gimme license to keep doing stuff that was already being done), and turning a creative vision into an actionable vision that they could then communicate to major partners like the developer for their flagship videogame and then hold said partners to...they would have set themselves up to avoid this sort of let down.<br /> <br /> &quot;Everything seemed fine and then sudden it wasn't,&quot; almost always means something very much was not fine the whole time. In this case it seems pretty obvious that HSL was making the game it wanted to make, because it had pitched Paradox/WW that, and had gotten a yes, but that game wasn't actually the game Paradox/WW wanted, and by the time Paradox/WW figured out that they were on a completely different page from HSL, it was too late to correct things quietly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455659#post1455659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's 'polical messages' and then there's 'political statements'.</div> </div> </div> </div>What do you perceive is the functional difference, and how does that difference apply to this thread (esp. as you did not make this differentiation until now)?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You would also do well to remember that game journalists get terrified by the notion of drinking blood, and are constantly seeking something to take out of context and be outraged about in order to maximise their clicks. Of course execs will get wishy washy with including such things. </div> </div> </div>And what, exactly, is any of this based on? Game journalists were completely amped for Bloodlines 2, until they were completely disappointed because it was clear that it had gone off the rails in development. All of the major outlets were completely positive about the blood-sucking game, and didn't need any sort of clickbait because Bloodlines is a bankable enough brand in video games that it gets clicks simply because there's news about it.<br /> <br /> Journalists also really don't like the whole outrage/clickbait thing, which is why you rarely actually see such things in the articles themselves, and instead it falls on the editors that toss on hyperbolic headlines, or incendiary tweets while linking to said articles. While there are certainly individuals that thrive in the social media driven clickbait ad revenue driven economy of online journalism, in general most journalists find it a net negative for their work rather than something they want to engage with (and as noted, it will get engaged with even if they don't).<br /> <br /> You also keep making really broad generalizations about things when the broad general trends just don't support your statements. Execs don't get wish-washy about the social media outrage machine, because they have access to the sales data and so on, so they know how much it really matters. They know how quickly the Internet moves on, and how little loud voices in various corners of it actually matter to butts in seats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-27T17:52:37-07:00","id":1455686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455678#post1455678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And what, exactly, is any of this based on? Game journalists were completely amped for Bloodlines 2, until they were completely disappointed because it was clear that it had gone off the rails in development. All of the major outlets were completely positive about the blood-sucking game, and didn't need any sort of clickbait because Bloodlines is a bankable enough brand in video games that it gets clicks simply because there's news about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>There was a game journalist from Polygon who played a small V5 game way back when it first came out, and the article was basically 'ugh this is bad' because of his 'uncomfortableness' with it. It was really weird.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.polygon.com/2018/7/25/17607080/vampire-the-masquerade-v5-white-wolf\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.polygon.com/2018/7/25/17...-v5-white-wolf</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-27T18:24:40-07:00","id":1455688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>elmerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455686#post1455686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There was a game journalist from Polygon who played a small V5 game way back when it first came out, and the article was basically 'ugh this is bad' because of his 'uncomfortableness' with it. It was really weird.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.polygon.com/2018/7/25/17607080/vampire-the-masquerade-v5-white-wolf\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.polygon.com/2018/7/25/17...-v5-white-wolf</a></div> </div> </div> </div>The thing about that is that:<br /> <br /> 1. It sounded like the writer was someone who was completely new to VtM (or at the very least, the TRPG version), not a fan that had immersed themselves in the lore and systems from years of playing it and had thus doesn't have any expectations on what VtM is like.<br /> <br /> 2. My understanding is that V5, in it's aims to push up the personal horror aspect, plays up the &quot;vampires as metaphor for sexual predator&quot; angle much more overtly then it did before, not just relative to the more recent editions before it, but relative to vampire media being released at the time. And considering I've heard of even veteran VtM fans choosing to downplay this aspect of vampires in their own games, well, it's not really surprising someone who's new to VtM would be put off by it.<br /> <br /> So no, I don't think it's particularly constructive or valid to make a blanket generalization that video game journalists just don't <i>get</i> VtM.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 07-27-2021, 09:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-27T18:36:48-07:00","id":1455689,"title":"","content":"Also... the coverage of VtMB2 and V5 aren't the same thing. The same Polygon writer's articles on the news about the video game are pretty much exactly what I described.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-27T23:29:55-07:00","id":1455703,"title":"","content":"And let's tell a full story here: V5 did need to add a load of appendices to address some of the OTT 'shock value' stuff in the core book, the Camarilla book had to be changed because of its crass references to real world tragedies, and finally nuWW was folded back into the parent company because the books kept having this same issue.<br /> <br /> So it's entirely reasonable that a reviewer unfamiliar with the TTRPG would be put off, when many hardcore fans had a similar reaction. But that has almost nothing to do with VTMB2. The problem was never vampires drinking blood but the focus on abuse, assault and squick that made people very uncomfortable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-29T02:05:05-07:00","id":1455746,"title":"","content":"Considering the content of their historical strategy games, I would find it strange for Paradox to find the world of darkness too dark or politically sensitive to make a game about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":26836,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","user":"Rhywbeth","date":". 07-29-2021, 05:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-29T07:40:10-07:00","id":1455752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rhywbeth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455746#post1455746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering the content of their historical strategy games, I would find it strange for Paradox to find the world of darkness too dark or politically sensitive to make a game about.</div> </div> </div> </div>I basically assumed that buying a beloved cult classic like VAMPIRE: BLOODLINES was more important to them than the entire World of Darkness.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-29T09:17:44-07:00","id":1455756,"title":"","content":"That too, but since they've already published three games that revolve around brutal scheming, backstabbing, blackmailing, seducing, murdering and generally ruining people's lives to improve one's lot in life (also; infanticide, kinslaying, infernalism, incest, cannibalism and human sacrifice) kindred politics should be familiar territory. Just add fangs. The Giovanni/Hecata in particular should feel right at home.<br /> <br /> ...Actually, a DAV pc game would be interesting.<br /> <br /> Anyway. Bloodlines is tame compared to Paradox Strategies, so it seems like there should be another reason for whatever the hell is going wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":26836,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","user":"Rhywbeth","date":". 07-29-2021, 03:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T13:33:21-07:00","id":1455811,"title":"","content":"Politics is a very broad word. Grasping at straws here, but A game about incestuous backstabbing kings doesn't inherently attack the current system where we're ruled by capitalism. Insinuating that the elite are fucking their sisters has been missing the mark for two hundred years now. A game where the big bads are caricatures of the modern elite and they're actively working to the detriment of the common people to a seemingly petty degree for an easier time feeding? That's a lot closer to home. People get a lot more iffy about politics when it concerns their interests.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying I support this or that it's rational. But if you're, say, an oil baron who branched out into investing in games, you're not going to be so keen on pentex/endron taking so much limelight when they suggest something that's not in their political interests. There was a big trilogy that shall not be named that came out recently, greatly hampered by real world politics. Sometimes sending the right politics is more important to these people than creating a timely good quality product.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T14:45:06-07:00","id":1455818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">For information to date, from what I've seen the whole &amp;quot;They fired Mitsoda/took it away from Hardsuit etc.&amp;quot; being sue to some supposed disliking of political messaging has all been unsubstantiated hearsay primarily pushed by edgelord youtubers looking to push out clickbait to right leaning outrage audiences or by similar social media figures. <br /> <br /> Avellone himself said nothing new here and this is likely just more of his gross return to social media to try to patch his soiled reputation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nailed it on both points, I imagine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T15:29:38-07:00","id":1455820,"title":"","content":"Yep, Tyrannical is definitely right. It had little to do with politics I imagine. Hardsuit Labs must've probably fudged up the making of Bloodlines 2 pretty bad, for Paradox to completely wipe them off the mark of development. <br /> <br /> I honestly think Paradox making an attempt Bloodlines 2 was a mistake. You just can't top a cult classic like Bloodlines 1. Its just one of those games that cannot be surpassed. <br /> <br /> I would've actually wanted for Paradox to stick to their specialty of Grand Strategy and make a VTM globe-spanning game where you can customize your own Vampire, then try to survive and then maybe conquer the &quot;World of Darkness&quot;. You can either start out as a Neonate trying to survive throughout the ages or maybe start your character as a recently awoken Methuselah who has to re-adapt to the age they've raised to. The plots, the Jyhads, making your shadow Empire grow stronger and stronger. That would be interesting. <br /> <br /> I know there are already mods of the line for VTM in the Crusader Kings franchise.. but as are all mod game-material, it's kinda wonky and does not feel authentic as an actual standalone game can do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T15:37:42-07:00","id":1455821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Avellone himself said nothing new here and this is likely just more of his gross return to social media to try to patch his soiled reputation.</div> </div> </div> </div>I, at least, had unaware that most or all of the people at Paradox who had been working with HSL on Bloodlines 2 had also been fired. I assumed there had been some sort of housecleaning but hadn't known it had extended that far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T16:34:35-07:00","id":1455824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455811#post1455811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Grasping at straws here,...</div> </div> </div> </div>Why?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A game where the big bads are caricatures of the modern elite and they're actively working to the detriment of the common people to a seemingly petty degree for an easier time feeding? That's a lot closer to home. People get a lot more iffy about politics when it concerns their interests. </div> </div> </div>Shall I list a combination of AAA and indie breakout hits that show that making the corporate elites evil (either as just a state of the setting, or as the direct antagonists of the game) is popular enough with players that video game companies are more than willing to make such games because the executives don't care if common people hate them as long as they keep paying them?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455821#post1455821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I, at least, had unaware that most or all of the people at Paradox who had been working with HSL on Bloodlines 2 had also been fired. I assumed there had been some sort of housecleaning but hadn't known it had extended that far.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not actually what Chris or anyone else said though. None of those people are employees at Paradox anymore. That doesn't mean they were all fired. Maybe they were, but the videogame industry has really high turnover rates and lots of people take new jobs once a big project ends, or has a big shake up at the top, etc. While it's odd that everyone in that category isn't working at Paradox anymore, we don't know how exactly it got that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T16:43:46-07:00","id":1455825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455820#post1455820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I honestly think Paradox making an attempt Bloodlines 2 was a mistake. You just can't top a cult classic like Bloodlines 1. Its just one of those games that cannot be surpassed. <br /> <br /> I would've actually wanted for Paradox to stick to their specialty of Grand Strategy and make a VTM globe-spanning game where you can customize your own Vampire, then try to survive and then maybe conquer the &quot;World of Darkness&quot;. You can either start out as a Neonate trying to survive throughout the ages or maybe start your character as a recently awoken Methuselah who has to re-adapt to the age they've raised to. The plots, the Jyhads, making your shadow Empire grow stronger and stronger. That would be interesting. <br /> <br /> I know there are already mods of the line for VTM in the Crusader Kings franchise.. but as are all mod game-material, it's kinda wonky and does not feel authentic as an actual standalone game can do.</div> </div> </div> </div>I doubt it's called Bloodlines for any reason other than to bank off the name, it's not really connected as far as I'm aware. Especially since they no longer have anyone connected to the original. I'm not expecting the second coming of a cult classic, I'd just be happy to have more games.<br /> <br /> A VtM strategy game does sound like an idea. Revolving around playing sect politics and enhancing your position while managing your herd, domain, finances and such. Rather than a set plot to follow,a story is created when you steer things with your own actions and stats while occasionally the RNG giveth and taketh away with events. <br /> <br /> You could even have different start dates incorporating Dark Ages and Victorian, and historical events in kindred history like the convention of thorns.<br /> <br /> There could be religious shenanigans with the Paths of Enlightenment.<br /> <br /> Crusader Kings usually does a great job of creating hilariously fucked up storylines, sometimes even genuinely emotional ones, so I think it could be doable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":26836,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","user":"Rhywbeth","date":". 07-30-2021, 07:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T17:10:27-07:00","id":1455827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rhywbeth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455825#post1455825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A VtM strategy game does sound like an idea. Revolving around playing sect politics and enhancing your position while managing your herd, domain, finances and such. Rather than a set plot to follow,a story is created when you steer things with your own actions and stats while occasionally the RNG giveth and taketh away with events.<br /> <br /> You could even have different start dates incorporating Dark Ages and Victorian, and historical events in kindred history like the convention of thorns.<br /> <br /> There could be religious shenanigans with the Paths of Enlightenment.<br /> <br /> Crusader Kings usually does a great job of creating hilariously fucked up storylines, sometimes even genuinely emotional ones, so I think it could be doable.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is exactly what I would want and what you describe is basically already in the CK franchise via mods, but again, its not really authentic and the base mechanics of CK don't support a true VTM strategy game. Basically what we're asking for would basically just be a digital session of VTM altogether- and that would be an amazing thing. To be honest, Bloodlines was just an action game with some RPG elements put into it. It was too linear and beyond a few different tidbits of different things with some specific clan routes, you basically could do everything and the mysticism of it would wear off (as with all adventure-style action games). <br /> <br /> I really think Paradox scooched-the-hooch with not abiding toward their specialty with RPG Grand Strategy games. Their acquisition of World of Darkness gives them a lot of material to work with and basically adapt a whole line of things for either an Open World Sandbox or Grand Strategy style games. <br /> <br /> Also an ideal VTM Grand Strategy game should have the start-date begin right after the fall of the Second City. It would allow a wide span of time to work with, especially if you want to play in the 4th generation and build up your own lineage. Not only would that be interesting, it would also be interesting even further to see the opportunities of what Alt-History that can take place, even more-so than in CK. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-30T19:54:10-07:00","id":1455832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455811#post1455811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Politics is a very broad word. Grasping at straws here, but A game about incestuous backstabbing kings doesn't inherently attack the current system where we're ruled by capitalism. Insinuating that the elite are fucking their sisters has been missing the mark for two hundred years now. A game where the big bads are caricatures of the modern elite and they're actively working to the detriment of the common people to a seemingly petty degree for an easier time feeding? That's a lot closer to home. People get a lot more iffy about politics when it concerns their interests.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying I support this or that it's rational. But if you're, say, an oil baron who branched out into investing in games, you're not going to be so keen on pentex/endron taking so much limelight when they suggest something that's not in their political interests. There was a big trilogy that shall not be named that came out recently, greatly hampered by real world politics. Sometimes sending the right politics is more important to these people than creating a timely good quality product.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, the elite don't mind sticking it to themselves.<br /> <br /> Anti-Capitalism is one of the most profitable products of capitalism. Which is why Werewolf: The Apocalypse: Earthblood can have you murdering the mercenaries serving Endron.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">For information to date, from what I've seen the whole &quot;They fired Mitsoda/took it away from Hardsuit etc.&quot; being due to some supposed disliking of political messaging has all been unsubstantiated hearsay primarily pushed by edgelord youtubers looking to push out clickbait to right leaning outrage audiences or by similar social media figures.<br /> <br /> Avellone himself said nothing new here and this is likely just more of his gross return to social media to try to patch his soiled reputation.</div> </div> </div> </div>New is a weird thing to want. You want something to substantiate what is already shared.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-30-2021, 10:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-31T00:59:13-07:00","id":1455840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455832#post1455832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh, the elite don't mind sticking it to themselves.<br /> <br /> Anti-Capitalism is one of the most profitable products of capitalism.<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on one's sense of humour. <br /> <br /> &quot;The rich are pigs&quot; is almost entirely harmless to the rich. They're happy to own that. Things can be a bit iffy if specific people are parodied; that's where lawsuits can come in. <br /> <br /> But if part of the game was an informative and compelling expose on how fucked a specific business is, and the publisher has friends that take advantage of that business, Then it becomes something publishers want to shut down.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-31T03:23:15-07:00","id":1455843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455824#post1455824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's not actually what Chris or anyone else said though. None of those people are employees at Paradox anymore. That doesn't mean they were all fired. Maybe they were, but the videogame industry has really high turnover rates and lots of people take new jobs once a big project ends, or has a big shake up at the top, etc. While it's odd that everyone in that category isn't working at Paradox anymore, we don't know how exactly it got that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering that Avellone felt it was worth noting and didn't give the impression that the exodus from Paradox was all simply typical, by-the-book, usual stuff where everyone just naturally went on their way. Instead his article implied that Bloodlines 2 was a huge clusterfuck and it's very likely people were shitcanned over it both at HSL and at Paradox. But I totally admit that maybe I'm reading a bit too much into it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-31T04:09:05-07:00","id":1455844,"title":"","content":"I certainly think he wants to imply some things, but he very carefully wrote it as, &quot;Nobody I worked with in the trenches is still there, and I have never asked them what happened. It all sounded painful. Not only did I not know why they were fired, were let go, quit, or whatever, but I respect their right to speak for themselves and they have, although in a limited capacity. I do think they were classy and respectful in their responses.&quot;<br /> <br /> I agree that he wants to draw attention to a number of oddities around it, but it's him speculating and he's clear about that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-31T11:10:22-07:00","id":1455865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2?p=1455844#post1455844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I certainly think he wants to imply some things, but he very carefully wrote it as, &quot;Nobody I worked with in the trenches is still there, and I have never asked them what happened. It all sounded painful. Not only did I not know why they were fired, were let go, quit, or whatever, but I respect their right to speak for themselves and they have, although in a limited capacity. I do think they were classy and respectful in their responses.&quot;<br /> <br /> I agree that he wants to draw attention to a number of oddities around it, but it's him speculating and he's clear about that.</div> </div> </div> </div>True but he knows how he and Mitsoda were fired right before virtually everyone else was.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-31T14:04:27-07:00","id":1455875,"title":"","content":"Even there he differentiates as Mitsoda was fired before any relevant interval, and Avellone didn't have his contract renewed. While minor in the large scheme of things, they're not identical situations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-31T16:55:19-07:00","id":1455885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rhywbeth</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Especially since they no longer have anyone connected to the original.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also to come back to this, for an albeit minor tidbit; Damsel is the only character that I know of that does make a re-appearance into Bloodlines 2. They even went as far to make trailers for her reveal, no doubt to scrape some nostalgia-juice out the barrel. I cannot fathom why she would be involved in the ongoings in Bloodlines 2 for, but we'll never know the exact reason for a long while I suppose. <br /> <br /> I honestly think a more effective Anarch character to reintroduce, would be Nines Rodriguez primarily. Damsel.. I don't think she's even much a fan favorite. The most popular female characters (though of course, is not objective, just me parsing the minutiae fandom surrounding VTM:B) in Bloodlines was Therese/Jeanette Morgan, Heather Poe because she's the one and only Ghoul you can have, followed by Velvet for the type of sexy attire she wears. <br /> <br /> Actually speaking of Heather, did any of the female users on this site ever want a male Ghoul option in Bloodlines? I never thought of it before since I'm a guy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"use